2024-05-01 12:00:03,123 ERROR [db] connection lost
Traceback (most recent call last):
  File "x.py", line 1
2024-05-01 12:00:04,000 WARNING [db] retrying
2024-05-01 12:00:05,500 CRITICAL [web] giving up
garbage line
""".splitlines()


